    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Korea Folk Village)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "One very interesting place to visit is the Korean Folk Village"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "located near the city of Suwon in Gyoung-gi Province,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "not far from the capital of Seoul."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "When you visit there,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "you can witness a traditional wedding ceremony,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "taste a variety of traditional foods,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and you can observe how Koreans lived during ancient times."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "It is a very popular attraction for many foreign visitors."
    },
